The following files contain portions derived from LongBar and have been
modified for Sidebar. The modifications include namespace and API changes,
layout/theme-key updates, .NET Framework 4.0 compatibility changes, and
integration with the current Sidebar code.

  CoreLib/Shell.cs
      Portions derived from LongBar/Core/General/Sidebar.cs.

  Sidebar/Themes/Aero/Theme.xaml
      Portions derived from LongBar/Themes/Aero.theme.xaml.

  Sidebar/Themes/Halloween/Theme.xaml
      Halloween theme adapted from the LongBar Halloween theme package
      (LongBar/Themes/2.0/Halloween.zip). Theme.xaml has been updated for
      the current Sidebar theme keys and control structure. The theme
      metadata identifies the original publisher as "LongBar Project
      Group".

  Sidebar/Themes/Halloween/Images/
      Pumpkin artwork included with the LongBar Halloween theme package.

  SGStore/MainWindow.xaml
  SGStore/MainWindow.xaml.cs
      Portions derived from LongBar/Library.xaml and Library.xaml.cs.

  OtherSDKs/LongBarTileLib/
      LongBar TileLib compatibility SDK. Tile.cs and AssemblyInfo.cs are
      adapted from LongBar/TileLib. The original LongBar copyright notice
      is retained in Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs.

  OtherSDKs/KSideBarTileSDK/
      Karl's Sidebar tile SDK compatibility sources, adapted from
      LongBar/KSideBarTileLib. The original LongBar copyright notice is
      retained in Properties/AssemblyInfo.cs.

